---
// F1 bento grid: 8 tiles, irregular spans. Carries the problem statement, the
// library counts, import, sync, pressure-free, and honest-pricing tiles.
// The nav's "Library" link targets this section's id.
---
<section class="section" id="library" aria-labelledby="bento-title">
  <div class="bento-head">
    <h2 id="bento-title">Everything the app does, in one look</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="bento">

    <article class="cell cell--2x2">
      <span class="mono-label">The problem</span>
      <h3>Why you freeze when it's your turn to talk</h3>
      <p>
        You've watched the shows, done the streaks, maybe taken classes. You
        understand most of what you hear. Then someone asks you a question and
        your mind goes blank. Vocabulary apps train recall. Grammar courses train
        rules. Neither trains your speech reflex.
      </p>
      <div class="problem-cols">
        <div>
          <h3>Production freeze <span class="level-tag">A2</span></h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Recognize words instantly, freeze when speaking</li>
            <li>Translation panic mid-sentence</li>
            <li>Know the answer, can't produce it in time</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Fluency plateau <span class="level-tag">B1-B2</span></h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Sentences come out hesitant and mechanical</li>
            <li>Speech is rule-driven instead of automatic</li>
            <li>Can't match native rhythm and energy</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="cell cell--pear">
      <span class="count" data-count="100" data-suffix="+">100+</span>
      <span class="mono-label">Curated episodes</span>
      <p>Recorded by a native speaker. Latin American history, cultural icons, everyday phenomena.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="cell cell--cyan">
      <span class="count" data-count="50" data-suffix="+">50+</span>
      <span class="mono-label">Two-minute episodes</span>
      <p>Short, deliberate Spanish. The A2 on-ramp from understanding to speaking.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="cell cell--cyan cell--2x1">
      <span class="mono-label">Your own content</span>
      <h3>Shadow anything you already watch</h3>
      <p>Import audio from TikTok, Instagram, or any video file. The app auto-transcribes it into the same synchronized shadowing experience as the curated library.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="cell cell--lav">
      <span class="mono-label">Synced text</span>
      <h3>Tap any word, jump there</h3>
      <p>Character-level sync between text and audio. Repeat one phrase until it feels natural.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="cell cell--mint">
      <span class="mono-label">Pressure-free</span>
      <h3>No live conversation, no judgment</h3>
      <p>Practice out loud, alone, at your pace. Confidence comes after you start, never before.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="cell cell--2x1">
      <span class="mono-label">Honest pricing</span>
      <h3>About 20% of the library is free forever</h3>
      <p>Premium is $14.99 a month or $99.99 a year, after a 3-day trial. No credit card to start.</p>
    </article>

    <p class="bento-aside">Spanish only. iOS only. On purpose.</p>

  </div>
</section>
